   It is NOT part of the source tree. `python mesin/bahts.py siapkan` downloads
   it to the user's computer from the Tarteel QUL mirror or, failing that, from
   an unmodified copy attached to this project's GitHub release (addresses and
   checksum: FONT_SUMBER and FONT_SHA256 in mesin/bahts.py). That copy is
   passed on free of charge under the font's own end-user license agreement,
   which is embedded in the font file. Publisher's site:
   https://fonts.qurancomplex.gov.sa

3. mesin/sampul.doc: the cover page follows a course template of
